+# Secrets for config/deploy.yml, read by Kamal using dotenv syntax.
+#
+# Keep this file safe for git: reference secrets from the environment, Rails
+# credentials, or a file instead of pasting raw values here. If you do put real
+# secrets in this file, don't commit them.
+#
+# Before your first `bin/kamal setup`:
+#
+#   * Run `bin/rails credentials:edit` once. That creates config/master.key
+#     (with a generated secret_key_base) and config/credentials.yml.enc.
+#
+#   * Set SMTP_PASSWORD in your environment, or replace the value below with
+#     your SMTP password (and keep that change out of git).
+#
+# To deploy with an external registry (see config/deploy.yml), also set:
+#
+#   KAMAL_REGISTRY_PASSWORD=$KAMAL_REGISTRY_PASSWORD
+
+RAILS_MASTER_KEY=$(cat config/master.key)
+SMTP_PASSWORD=$SMTP_PASSWORD
